---
title: "Sequence Diagram - Draw Story Illustrations"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Parent
  participant W as Web App
  participant R as :StoriesRoutes
  participant C as :StoriesController
  participant IS as :StoriesImagesService
  participant CL as :CreditLedger
  participant Q as :AiQueue
  participant P as :AiProcessor
  participant IST as :StoriesImagesStore
  participant AI as :AiClient
  participant DB as Database
  participant AIS as AI Service
  participant CD as Cloudinary

  Note over U,CD: 1. Request illustrations (also triggered automatically after AI writes a story with useAiImage)
  U->>W: Click Draw illustrations
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/stories/:id/images
  R->>C: drawImages(req, res)
  C->>IS: drawStoryImages(user, storyId)
  IS->>DB: SELECT story (owner), users.aiBlockedUntil
  alt not found / published copy / story generating / AI blocked
    IS-->>C: ApiError 404 / 403 / 409 / 403
    C-->>W: error
  else ok
    IS->>DB: UPDATE stories SET useAiImage = true (if off)
    IS->>IS: queueStoryImages(storyId)
    IS->>DB: SELECT scenes, story characters, image costs
    loop each character with appearance and no portrait
      IS->>DB: BEGIN, character portraitStatus queued, INSERT ai_requests (character_portrait)
      IS->>CL: holdCredit(userId, portrait cost)
      IS->>DB: COMMIT
      IS->>Q: enqueueAiJob(character_portrait)
    end
    loop each scene with description and no image
      alt a character portrait is still being drawn
        IS->>DB: UPDATE story_scenes SET imageStatus queued (wait for portrait)
      else portraits ready
        IS->>DB: BEGIN, INSERT ai_requests (scene_image), scene imageStatus queued
        IS->>CL: holdCredit(userId, scene cost)
        IS->>DB: COMMIT
        IS->>Q: enqueueAiJob(scene_image)
      end
    end
    alt credit ran out before anything was queued
      IS->>DB: waiting scenes back to imageStatus none
      IS-->>C: ApiError 402
      C-->>W: 402 Not enough credit to draw
    else queued
      IS-->>C: portraits, scenes, waiting counts
      C-->>W: 200 drawing started
      W-->>U: Show drawing progress
    end
  end

  Note over U,CD: 2. Worker draws each image (background)
  loop each portrait / scene job
    Q->>P: processAiJob(character_portrait or scene_image)
    P->>IST: markProcessing, loadPortraitInput / loadSceneInput
    IST->>DB: SELECT appearance / scene description (real names removed), portrait refs
    P->>AI: callAi(job, payload)
    AI->>AIS: POST /v1/images/portrait or /v1/images/scene
    AIS->>CD: upload image
    CD-->>AIS: image key
    AIS-->>AI: image_key
    alt success
      P->>IST: persistImageResult(aiRequestId, response)
      IST->>DB: BEGIN, ai_requests succeeded, write portraitImageKey / scene imageKey (ready)
      IST->>CL: consumeCredit
      IST->>DB: COMMIT
      opt portrait finished
        P->>IS: resumeAfterPortrait(characterId)
        IS->>IS: queueStoryImages for stories with waiting scenes
      end
    else blocked by content filter / AI error
      P->>IST: finalizeImageFailure(failed or blocked)
      IST->>DB: BEGIN, ai_requests failed / blocked, status failed
      IST->>CL: releaseCredit
      IST->>DB: COMMIT
    end
  end

  Note over U,CD: 3. Redraw one scene and set cover
  U->>W: Click Redraw on a scene
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/stories/:id/scenes/:sceneId/image
  R->>C: redrawScene(req, res)
  C->>IS: redrawScene(user, storyId, sceneId)
  alt scene not found / no description / already drawing
    IS-->>C: ApiError 404 / 422 / 409
    C-->>W: error
  else ok
    IS->>IS: queueStoryImages(storyId, [sceneId]) (same as step 1)
    C-->>W: 200 redraw queued
  end
  U->>W: Choose a scene as cover
  W->>R: PUT /api/v1/stories/:id/cover {sceneId}
  R->>C: setCover(req, res)
  C->>DB: StoriesService.setCover: scene must have image (else 422), UPDATE stories SET coverSceneId
  C-->>W: 200 cover updated
